                                "sense_id": "80822e38-5801-3e35-8350-870a868a3838",
                                "text": "De politici stonden lijnrecht tegenover elkaar op het strijdperk van het debat.",
                                "translation": "The politicians were at odds with each other on the field of contention in the debate.",
